#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:560
msgid ""
"An example log file of actions for measuring KDE’s text and code editor "
"[`Kate`](https://apps.kde.org/kate/). The (i) date and time as well as (ii) "
"start and stop times and (iii) actions are listed in three columns."
msgstr ""
