msgstr "شكر وتقدير"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1227
msgid ""
"Thank you to the many contributors to the KDE Eco initiative in general "
"(listed in alphabetical order by first name): Achim Guldner, Adriaan de "
"Groot, Aleix Pol, Alexander Semke, André Pönitz, Björn Balazs, Carl Schwan, "
"Chris Adams, Christopher Stumpf, David Hurka, Fabian, Felix Behrens, "
"Franziska Mai, Harald Sitter, Jens Gröger, Johnny Jazeix, Jonathan Esk-"
