#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:28
msgid ""
"The text of this version of the handbook was written and compiled from "
"various sources by Joseph P. De Veaugh-Geiss. Annie Musgrove edited the text "
"according to KDE Eco editorial guidelines. Anita Sengupta and Arwin Neil "
"Baichoo made the book and website design beautiful."
msgstr ""
