msgid ""
"[Umstieg auf Linux](https://lug-vs.org/lugvswiki/index.php/"
"Umstieg_auf_Linux) -- Preparing for a Linux install party, from LUG "
"Villingen-Schwenningen e.V. (German) (2025)"
msgstr ""
